														as for looting:<br />
<br />
Group leaders ONLY will loot all bodies their group gained exp. on. Group leaders know not to loot a NO DROP item. They will announce what class it is for and give a brief description. Those classes within the raid will lotto for the item (in as much as the following rules have not disqualified you from the lotto.) <br />
<br />
2) Lotto's will be based upon need vs. greed. If you lotto for an Item you think you need and you come to find out you either don't like the item as you thought you would or you would like to find better it's your choice what to do with it. How ever if you're found Lottoing for items you cant even use you will lose all lotto rights. <br />
<br />
3) If you don't get your name in a timely fashion and you miss the lotto that is your own fault. The person in charge of the lotto's will make sure they say something 4 or 5 times. We will *NOT* re-roll for any item that is being lottoed. Make sure YOUR SHOUT AND OOC ARE ON!!! Usually loot and lotto will be announced in SHOUT. We would like all group leaders to use this channel when announcing these items and lotto's. ONE person will be designated to handle/administer (guild leaders will elect the individual) lotto's and they will have the Final say as to WHO won. NO disputing will be allowed. Gather around this person for the lotto IF you are in it. <br />
<br />
4) If Several classes can us the item it is lottoed. <br />
<br />
<br />
4A) Gear: If you have lottoed and won a piece for your CLASS you are OUT of future lotto's for gear until EVERYONE IN YOUR CLASS has won ONE piece. If you are the only one of your class that is there and we have a piece drop it automatically goes to you. As we practice NEED before Greed, if you already have the item, (unless its a Bracer) you not allowed to Lotto again. (Bracers don't count.) <br />
4B) If a Piece of GEAR drops and it is DROPABLE/Tradable and no one of that class or race is there that can use it, Group Leaders will will lotto for it. From there the group leader will obtain the item and that group will lotto for it, Using /random 1 10. Having 30 people or so /random is too much of a pain to keep up with. <br />
4C) Weapons are different lotto from Class armor. If a weapon drops and you have won an Item of your class armor you are still in a lotto for that weapon. Again, winners stay out until all have won a weapon. <br />
<br />
5) Words and research items come to Aamaorn and a person appointed by the co-raiding guild. The guilds will give them to the classes that need them for researching. <br />
<br />
6) All gems and sellable (non-lotto) items come to Aamaorn (or whom ever has been designated for Guild item/$ Collection. It is expensive to run raids. Fear is a free walk in zone but we have to usually pay for the clerics gems and such that they use for buffs. Hate costs about 215pp a group of 6 to go. <br />
<br />
7) ANYTHING You have rightfully won from a lotto is yours. You have the right to do with it as you wish. <br />
<br />
8) We will split all plat within the group, either as an even amount is collected or at the end of the raid, as stated before we start.						</td>
